# In dev, requests go through Vite's proxy (see vite.config.ts) which forwards
# /api to http://localhost:8080, so no env var is needed for local development.
#
# For a later, non-proxied deployment where the frontend and neuro-san server
# are on different origins, set AGENT_ALLOW_CORS_HEADERS=1 in the neuro-san
# server's own environment (not this file) and point the client at the
# server's real origin instead of a relative /api path.
